DreamLake is an application available to all tourists who go to the lakes Maggiore, Garda and Como. An easy-to-use, intuitive tool that helps travellers choose which towns to visit and guides them to discover the many sights all around the area of the lakes.

DreamLake app services:
•	Once you download the app and log in, on the top of the screen you will find the News section with information on excursions, cruises and news;
•	Right below are three sections about the lakes Maggiore, Garda and Como set in three different colours: Points of Interest (POI), Augmented Reality and Routes;
•	You can pick your language preference (Italian or English) and turn on push notifications to receive updates on new proposals;
•	On the app, you can see the timetables of the scheduled transport services, which are always up-to-date, and even buy your travel tickets (currently only for some types);
•	To rate service, you can leave your customer satisfaction opinion using a rating system of 1 to 5 stars. 

Features to know:
1.	The interactive map shows you the geolocalised points of interest and allows you to find the right direction when traveling around the lake and decide which places to visit;
2.	Points of Interest feature texts and pointing links with useful information for discovering the local attractions of the lake area;
3.	Routes, always new and different, describe itineraries told from the traveller’s point of view;
4.	Augmented Reality, which is activated by your smartphone camera, will display while browsing the points of interest of the surrounding area, providing you information with just one click.
All that remains for you to do is to download Navigazione Laghi's new DreamLake app and start dreaming lakes Maggiore, Garda and Como.
